    "description": "TypeFrenzy– Real-time multiplayer typing speed game built with React, Node.js, MongoDB, and Socket.io. Features real-time rooms, synced typing sessions, global leaderboard, profile dashboard, and JWT-based auth. Used Chart.js for analytics and deployed via Render + Vercel.",
